t)},\\,12 \\sin{\\left(t \\right)},\\,z⟩\n$$\n\nwhere $t\\in[0,2\\pi)$ and $z\\in(-\\infty,\\infty)$.\n\nTherefore, the second component of $f$ is $12 \\sin{\\left(t \\right)}$."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186556023 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "7e7bc743-1756-58f2-ad7b-24d240238458" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6 \\cos{\\left(t \\right)}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186556027} {:answer/id #uuid "ad80797e-5f7a-53d7-9310-18907616491b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\sin{\\left(t \\right)}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186556038} {:answer/id #uuid "b9fa2a36-be18-5717-80e6-c1e3c9dcc761" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6 z" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186556041} {:answer/id #uuid "d878bf6e-bca7-5958-bfc5-aa81e9e00f4a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\cosh{\\left(t \\right)}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186556046} {:answer/id #uuid "db96e8eb-5818-5d5a-b257-837eaea2a440" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6 z^{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186556047}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "7e7bc743-1756-58f2-ad7b-24d240238458" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6 \\cos{\\left(t \\right)}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186556027} :answer-field/id #uuid "42089e4d-7340-5c78-acfd-e1e275415df2" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186556016}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "6dd38cb6-60b4-5980-b4a8-7ef8538e2cca" :question/problem "$$\nf(t,z)=⟨\\text{_____},\\,12 \\sin{\\left(t \\right)},\\,z⟩\n$$\n\nThe vector-valued function $f(t,z)$ above parametrizes the elliptic cylinder defined in Cartesian coordinates 